---
description: Terminal command execution rules for materials-kg
alwaysApply: true
---

1. Always activate venv before running Python:
   - PowerShell: `.venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1`
   - WSL/Linux: `source .venv/bin/activate`
2. Detect default terminal (PowerShell vs WSL) and use the correct activation command
3. Only then execute Python or pytest commands
4. See [`AGENTS.md`](./AGENTS.md) for full dev commands (install, test, lint, build)
